lds.result` in real time\n- Returns `ActionOutput` with `object_count`, `objects`, and conditionally `truncated`/`total_count`\n\n**`/tmp/aws-object-storage-demo/extension-code/src/actions/upload_file.py`** — Implements the `upload_file` action:\n- Validates local file existence with `os.path.isfile()`; raises `ValidationError` (exit code 20) if missing\n- Creates `S3ClientUtility` then calls `s3_client.upload_file(local_file_path, bucket_name, s3_object_key)`\n- Retrieves the ETag via `s3_client.get_etag(bucket_name, s3_object_key)` (quotes already stripped by utility)\n- Prints confirmation to STDOUT: `Uploaded <path> to s3://<bucket>/<key>`\n- Updates `OutputFields.status` and `OutputFields.result`; returns `ActionOutput` with `s3_uri`, `bucket`, `key`, `etag`\n\n**`/tmp/aws-object-storage-demo/extension-code/src/actions/__init__.py`** — Updated `ACTION_MAPPER` to map `\"List Objects\"` → `list_objects` and `\"Upload File\"` → `upload_file`, matching the `SingleChoice` values defined in `InputFields._validate_action()`.","background_tasks":[],"session_crons":[]}

